Scope of this licence
---------------------
The MIT licence below applies only to the original source code and documentation
written for this project (the dashboard/ application, its tests and documentation,
and the scripts in src/).

It does NOT apply to the BPI Challenge 2017 dataset or to any data derived from it,
including the CSV reports in reports/ and the processed event log. The dataset was
created by Boudewijn van Dongen and is published by 4TU.ResearchData under the
4TU General Terms of Use (https://doi.org/10.4121/resource:terms_of_use). Those terms,
including attribution and non-commercial use only, continue to apply to the dataset
and to everything derived from it. The author of this project claims no ownership of
the dataset.

Dataset citation: van Dongen, Boudewijn (2017): BPI Challenge 2017.
4TU.ResearchData. Dataset. https://doi.org/10.4121/uuid:5f3067df-f10b-45da-b98b-86ae4c7a310b

